<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-064" chapter-id="c-jinshu-064-jin098-dun" source-id="s-jinshu-064-jin098-dun">
  <p id="c-jinshu-064-jin098-dun:succession" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-064-jin098-dun:succession:m0000" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA">元帝</persName>以<persName id="c-jinshu-064-jin098-dun:succession:m0003" ref="9o2_vhv_r7y">東海王越</persName>世子<persName id="c-jinshu-064-jin098-dun:succession:m0009" ref="1d1_298_a7e">毗</persName>沒于<persName id="c-jinshu-064-jin098-dun:succession:m0012" ref="0c9_95a_18b">石勒</persName>，不知存亡，乃以<persName id="c-jinshu-064-jin098-dun:succession:m0022" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAC">沖</persName>繼<persName id="c-jinshu-064-jin098-dun:succession:m0024" ref="1d1_298_a7e">毗</persName>後，稱東海世子，以毗陵郡增本封邑萬戶，又改食下邳、蘭陵，以<persName id="c-jinshu-064-jin098-dun:succession:m0054" ref="9o2_vhv_r7y">越</persName>妃<persName id="c-jinshu-064-jin098-dun:succession:m0056" ref="q0t_km8_nru">裴氏</persName>為太妃，拜長水校尉。</p>
</text>
